<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
    .header { background: #10b981; color: white; padding: 20px; text-align: center; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; }
    .content { padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #eee; border-top: none; border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px; }
    .stat-box { display: inline-block; width: 30%; text-align: center; background: #f9fafb; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 1%; }
    .stat-value { font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; color: #10b981; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h2>Your Weekly Progress Digest</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
      <p>Hello {{username}},</p>
      <p>Here's a quick look at your problem-solving progress this week!</p>
      
      <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 20px;">
        <div class="stat-box">
          <div class="stat-value">{{problemsSolvedThisWeek}}</div>
          <div style="font-size: 12px; color: #666;">Problems Solved</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-box">
          <div class="stat-value">{{submissionsCount}}</div>
          <div style="font-size: 12px; color: #666;">Submissions</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-box">
          <div class="stat-value">{{ratingChange}}</div>
          <div style="font-size: 12px; color: #666;">Rating Change</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <p>Keep up the great work! Consistent practice is the key to mastery.</p>
      <a href="{{profileUrl}}" style="display: block; text-align: center; margin-top: 20px; color: #10b981;">View your full profile</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
